#: ee04ed81c60f4bdabcae634cd8d43bd3
msgid "There are various ways to get all of these utilities for your system. You may consult `Arduino's Linux guide <http://playground.arduino.cc/learning/linux>`__ for instructions on installing the AVR toolchain under Linux."
msgstr ""

